    "home_faq_xK3HGp": {
      "type": "home-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "text_qyG8py": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "category": "",
            "hd": "<p>Floor coverage and fit</p>",
            "des": "<p><strong>– Will the mats definitely fit?</strong><br/>Yes, our EVA mats are designed specifically for every make, model and version, and they cover the whole floor area including places that rubber or velour mats do not protect.</p><p><strong>– What is a tunnel mat?</strong><br/>EVA mats cover up to 98% of the floor including the centre tunnel and give maximum protection.</p><p><strong>– Is the heel pad fitted to the driver's mat?</strong><br/>No, the heel pad is supplied separately so you can position it to your own preference.</p>",
            "des_html": ""
          }
        },
        "text_eNMPaU": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "category": "",
            "hd": "<p>Material properties and durability</p>",
            "des": "<p><strong>– What is EVA material?</strong><br/>It is a 10 mm thick foam that traps dirt and water on the surface of the mat and stops them getting underneath.</p><p><strong>– What is the difference between a 3D set and a 3D set with edges?</strong><br/>A 3D set with edges gives extra protection to the side trim of the floor and a better fit.</p><p><strong>– How long do the mats last?</strong><br/>Thanks to the durable EVA material the mats last 5 to 7 years without signs of wear.</p>",
            "des_html": ""
          }
        },
        "text_fUwAtz": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "category": "",
            "hd": "<p>Use and care</p>",
            "des": "<p><strong>– How do I clean EVA mats?</strong><br/>Dirt does not cling to the surface of the mat. Just shake it out, or rinse it with a pressure washer if it is heavily soiled.</p><p><strong>– Are EVA mats suitable for summer and winter?</strong><br/>Yes, they are water-resistant, odourless, temperature-resistant and ideal for year-round use.</p>",
            "des_html": ""
          }
        },
        "text_imjMCm": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "category": "",
            "hd": "<p>Ordering and delivery</p>",
            "des": "<p><strong>– What is the delivery time?</strong><br/>We usually fulfil orders within 2 weeks. For special vehicles such as motorboats or tractors it can extend to 4–6 weeks.</p><p><strong>– How is delivery handled?</strong><br/>We send the mats by courier straight to the customer's address. Because of the size of the product we do not send mats to parcel lockers. We make sure they arrive exactly as they were made — without folding or bending that could affect the fit.</p>",
            "des_html": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
